      "source_offset": 11272,
      "source_byte_length": 34,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10494
      ],
      "text": "In a way, the woman leading the Imperial Army"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002c2c": {
      "resource_row": 12,
      "source_sha256": "76b3f678bdd27135eee5df89c495b867165c3f52864faf659abbf2df2061d502",
      "source_offset": 11308,
      "source_byte_length": 16,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10502
      ],
      "text": "is worthy of respect."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002c3e": {
      "resource_row": 13,
      "source_sha256": "808cb8fde585d77b2797012be90c5d2676938a8447c925a5797a632f5d2527b9",
      "source_offset": 11326,
      "source_byte_length": 20,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10536
      ],
      "text": "To give one's life for country and honor,"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002c54": {
      "resource_row": 14,
      "source_sha256": "ff85e3ff1f974f30b84af9acbe15a7700f33a74df39939f0aa276e50f202c2b3",
      "source_offset": 11348,
      "source_byte_length": 18,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10544
      ],
      "text": "and fulfill one's duty..."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002c68": {
      "resource_row": 15,
      "source_sha256": "24f1d95b2932bd080552cc74d0a2c68a22b3acdb008e5ef822081d0fe45bd0bf",
      "source_offset": 11368,
      "source_byte_length": 20,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10578
      ],
      "text": "The ideals she spoke of"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002c7e": {
      "resource_row": 16,
      "source_sha256": "a52e8f84c0c2fa29e021869296904fd3aaa8d8535fae0a2730b8171a69718c99",
      "source_offset": 11390,
      "source_byte_length": 34,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10586
      ],
      "text": "are considered virtues in Silturn."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002ca2": {
      "resource_row": 17,
      "source_sha256": "2c31b84cdbd6b9bec98f9dd5c36cdaf6a68e886db58859bedc20f09e1cf18407",
      "source_offset": 11426,
      "source_byte_length": 18,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10614
      ],
      "text": "Yes. As a soldier,"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002cb6": {
      "resource_row": 18,
      "source_sha256": "696fad3cf2d0f509921028262df11619041db7120053adde3dceb51c594edf67",
      "source_offset": 11446,
      "source_byte_length": 36,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10622
      ],
      "text": "Azlier's way of thinking is admirable."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002cdc": {
      "resource_row": 19,
      "source_sha256": "2c31b84cdbd6b9bec98f9dd5c36cdaf6a68e886db58859bedc20f09e1cf18407",
      "source_offset": 11484,
      "source_byte_length": 18,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10642
      ],
      "text": "Yes. As a soldier,"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002cf0": {
      "resource_row": 20,
      "source_sha256": "717d492d33a9f860dd2937739b3447d36ddefaced493b75c34c4f2be2d3ad8bf",
      "source_offset": 11504,
      "source_byte_length": 38,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10650
      ],
      "text": "I think Azlier's way of thinking is admirable."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002d18": {
      "resource_row": 21,
      "source_sha256": "f8b7804a7530b90a9734202e7c760a7905d90bfc0b2a55f8f972bb9017c00a1f",
      "source_offset": 11544,
      "source_byte_length": 20,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10684
      ],
      "text": "But I agree that you"
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002d2e": {
      "resource_row": 22,
      "source_sha256": "06df54fc702f2944583112bf44481627b6c892540520c1ec792eba7c5a614b37",
      "source_offset": 11566,
      "source_byte_length": 36,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10692
      ],
      "text": "have no obligation to follow it."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002d54": {
      "resource_row": 23,
      "source_sha256": "674615295de5bfb6e38c3d8e0bec73211478dd1fbc6ed0697a1805f4d1640cce",
      "source_offset": 11604,
      "source_byte_length": 14,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10720
      ],
      "text": "Kyuuma..."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002d64": {
      "resource_row": 24,
      "source_sha256": "cb8511de33ca89c6a68b41c767beb2f0fe616d4a7d96b74fc17d4c4ac8fb1f7e",
      "source_offset": 11620,
      "source_byte_length": 18,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10740
      ],
      "text": "Kyuuma..."
    },
    "00:00210:text:00002d78": {
      "resource_row": 25,
      "source_sha256": "e2bd72a00eff4b4e93c8912c5c83b20c6ebaec8c407b860fa0d36b3eaed5a68e",
      "source_offset": 11640,
      "source_byte_length": 14,
      "reference_instructions": [
        10776
      ],
      "text": "There is no single, absolute justice"
